4	 * The arena scene has exactly one drawing strategy: `paint()` destroys every
5	 * game object and builds the whole floor again. That is fine for a state tick
6	 * and fatal for a drag — the token under the pointer is one of the objects
7	 * that gets destroyed, so a tick landing mid-drag deletes the thing the player
8	 * is holding and rebuilds it back in its old station. The drag looks like it
9	 * snapped back and the drop lands on nothing.
